# The Worker's one secret. On Cloudflare, add it under the assistant Worker's
# Settings → Variables and Secrets as type Secret; deploys keep it.

# Opens the admin page (/admin), where the admin adds the two people, connects
# the iCloud calendar and ChatGPT, and chooses the assistant's model. Use at
# least 32 random characters from a password manager. `npm run dev` needs no
# token, so locally this file is optional (copy it to cloudflare/.dev.vars,
# which Git ignores).
# ADMIN_TOKEN=
